    "detailed_description": "<strong>+ PC Maker</strong> is a simulation game in which you have to assemble and customize computers, and also improve your home/office as you progress through the game.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138760/extras/459511b81161084b90f614f11a79ab53.avif?t=1749798398\" width=648 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, we have worked out a good system for assembling and customizing a PC, so you can make a PC assembly that is closest to what you would like to assemble in life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing the PC build, you can install the operating system on it and test it in various benchmarks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138760/extras/8e24a9c80e378fc811b291272cbc6002.avif?t=1749798398\" width=648 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The construction system is also well developed, thanks to which you can create amazingly detailed interiors.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>+ PC Maker</strong> is a simulation game in which you have to assemble and customize computers, and also improve your home/office as you progress through the game.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138760/extras/459511b81161084b90f614f11a79ab53.avif?t=1749798398\" width=648 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, we have worked out a good system for assembling and customizing a PC, so you can make a PC assembly that is closest to what you would like to assemble in life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing the PC build, you can install the operating system on it and test it in various benchmarks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138760/extras/8e24a9c80e378fc811b291272cbc6002.avif?t=1749798398\" width=648 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The construction system is also well developed, thanks to which you can create amazingly detailed interiors.</p>",
